  - `architecture/` - model support (Gemma 2/3/4, Qwen 2/3/3.5, Llama, Mistral, Mixtral, Phi3, GLM4, etc.)
  - `cache/` - KV cache implementations (FP16, quantized, recurrent)
  - `conversion/` - model conversion and quantization tools
  - CUDA kernels (attention, GEMM, norm, activation, etc.)
